      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLORAS FOLLY (7) was in the money two runs ago then was about the mark again last time over 1780m at this track, finishing 3 metres from the winner in third. No harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon. Won't find this any harder and she can take care of this line-up. LUVATINNY (1) drew wide last start and was easily accounted for, beaten 24 metres into sixth at this track over 1780m. Starts from a far better position this time and is good enough to put herself right in the finish. JUSTANOTHER TORQUE (8) is a great chance after a string of sound recent performances, the latest a solid fifth at Albion Park over 1660m. Hard to find fault. PICCOLO DIAVOLO (5) is in the mix following a respectable second at his most recent appearance over 1780m at this track.",
